# Build contexts must never carry secrets or local state into an image layer
# (not even a builder stage). Patterns are root-relative in Docker, so every
# secret pattern is written with **/ to match at any depth.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/keycloak_data.yaml
**/keycloak_data.yaml.*
**/keys/
**/backups/
**/scratch-fixtures/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.bak
**/*.bak-*
**/*.tdf
**/*.tdf.html
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/records.json
**/config.js
**/node_modules
**/dist
webapp/src/wrapper/generated/
webapp/e2e/out/
